<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n95501" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σμήχω</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
			Hp.
			<u>Acut.</u>
			65
		</span></i>, impf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔσμηχον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					6.226
				</span></i>
			: aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔσμηξα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
				</span></i>
			 (v. infr.), <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				25.331
			</span></i>, etc.:—
				Med.
			 and 
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σμήχομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Acut.</u>
				</span></i>
			 l.c.: aor.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσμήχθην </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δι-</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				1237
			</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσμηξάμην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Steril.</u>
					219
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Superf.</u>
				25
			</span></i>: pf.
			part.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσμηγμένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					5.79
				</span></i>
			:—lengthd. form of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σμάω</span>, <i>wipe off</i> by help of soap or unguent (cf.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σμῆμα, σμῆγμα</span>), <i>wash
			off</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ κεφαλῆς δ᾽ ἔσμηχεν ἁλὸς χνόον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
				</span></i>
			 l.c. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>clear off</i> by help of lotions or salves, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀχῶρας, λέπρας</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.33
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.9
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>purge away</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλέγμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>CA</u>
					1.10
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>soap</i> a person, <i>wash</i> him <i>with soap</i> or
				<i>unguent</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Acut.</u>
			</span></i> l.c.; <i>wipe clean</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				876
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσπίδα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Babr.
					76.12
				</span></i>
			: prov., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Αἰθίοπα ς</span>.
				'<i>wash</i> a blackamoor white', <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Ind.</u>
				28
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Zen.
				1.46
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Diogenian.
				1.45
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			 and 
				Pass.
			, <i>wash oneself</i> or <i>get oneself washed with
				soap</i> or <i>unguent</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Acut.</u>
			</span></i> l.c.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σμηξάσθω τὴν
			κεφαλήν</span> Id.<u>Steril.</u> l.c.,
			<u>Superf.</u> l.c.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σμηχομένα
				κρόταφον</span>
			<i>wiping her</i> brow <i>clean,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				6.276
			</span></i> (Antip.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς ὀδόντας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					3.4.16
				</span></i>
			; of hair, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔρῳ κυνείῳ σμήχου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Archig.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.443
			</span></i>.</div>
